{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19949","headline":"春集越州皇甫秀才山亭 · 孟郊","name":"春集越州皇甫秀才山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉宾在何处，置亭春山巅。\n顾余寂寞者，谬厕芳菲筵。\n视听日澄澈，声光坐连绵。\n晴湖泻峰嶂，翠浪多萍藓。\n何以逞高志，爲君吟秋天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}